"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ride to your heart's content by upgrading performance parts and pimp out your vehicle's exterior with a range of cosmetic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569610/extras/b193665f285d66fe855b92ff5541fde9.poster.avif?t=1727537199\" width=700 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569610/extras/b193665f285d66fe855b92ff5541fde9.webm?t=1727537199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569610/extras/b193665f285d66fe855b92ff5541fde9.mp4?t=1727537199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore the Isle of Cock to gather ingredients from forests, fields, and waters. Whether mushrooms, vegetables, or fresh fish, a variety of ingredients await discovery. With gathered ingredients, unleash culinary creativity by cooking meals offering powerful benefits\u2014from health restoration to strength or agility boosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569610/extras/64ec053813cab4c0145617fa9eacc738.poster.avif?t=1727537199\" width=700 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569610/extras/64ec053813cab4c0145617fa9eacc738.webm?t=1727537199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569610/extras/64ec053813cab4c0145617fa9eacc738.mp4?t=1727537199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But that's just the beginning of the adventures awaiting you in Turbo Chicken Simulator! Dive into a world brimming with endless possibilities, from trying your luck at the casino to becoming a taxi driver navigating the bustling streets of the Isle of Cock. Customize your character with a plethora of outfits, explore diverse stores offering unique items, and delve into countless other activities that promise to keep you entertained for hours on end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the excitement doesn't stop there \u2013 we're committed to delivering fresh content and new features to enhance your gaming experience.  So, gear up, spread your wings, and get ready for an adventure like no other!</p>",
